      "text_unit_id": "tu_0001",
      "verbatim_text": "In patients with chronic or recurrent hyperkalaemia on RAAS inhibitors therapy an approved $K^+$ -lowering agent may be initiated as soon as $K^+$ levels are confirmed as $>5.0$ mEq/L. Closely monitor $K^+$ levels. Maintain treatment unless alternative treatable aetiology is identified."
