      "verbatim_text": "In patients with $K^+$ levels of $>6.5$ mEq/L on either maximal or sub-maximal tolerated, guideline-recommended target dose of RAAS inhibitor therapy, it is recommended to discontinue/reduce RAAS inhibitor. Treatment with a $K^+$ -lowering agent may be initiated as soon as $K^+$ levels $>5.0$ mEq/L. $K^+$ level should be closely monitored."
